    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Quaint, older style, split level extended cottage on an elevated site with panoramic Atlantic views looking out to the world famous Skellig Michael. Located a short drive to Waterville, ideal for walking/hiking and situated close to the 9th century Loher Ringfort. This is an area steeped in old Irish folklore with a rich history. A property that can be enjoyed for a myriad of activities, walking, fishing (nearby pier and beach), sea sports and archaeological discovery or further developed if so wished. Close by, Waterville has many restaurants and bars to enjoy with a seafront promenade and is home to two first class golf courses; world renowned Waterville Golf Links and Hogs Head Golf Course. Waterville lake stretches out behind the village with sea trout and salmon fishing. Plenty to occupy the outdoorsy holiday maker, an ideal holiday home from which to explore South Kerry.\r\nAccommodation comprises of a glazed front entrance door to sunroom with panoramic sea views, living room windows to sea views, steps from sunroom to main hallway, kitchen above sunroom with rear scullery and door to rear garden, three bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\nOutside the property is approached over a rising stone driveway with ample parking and turning. The grounds are laid mainly to lawn with well defined boundaries, mature shrubs and hedging. Also, benefitting from large workshop/storage to the side.\r\nBER: D2. BER No: 119148278."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sun Room: 2.07m x 5.19m - Windows to stunning views\r\nLiving Room: 5.9m x 4.58m - Feature stone fireplace with stove, wooden floor, windows to stunning views\r\nKitchen/Dining: 4.19m x 3.45m - Tiled floor, tiled splash back, feature stone fireplace with stove, built in storage\r\nUtility Room: 2.14m x 1.74m - Tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine, housing oil boiler, half glazed door to garden\r\nHallway: 4.37m x 1.09m - Tiled floor, half paneling to walls\r\nBedroom 1: 3.18m x 3.69m - Feature timber ceiling\r\nBedroom 2: 3.72m x 2.62m\r\nBathroom/Wet Room: 2.83m x 1.52m - Mira electric shower, fully tiled, w.c, wash hand basin\r\nBedroom 3: 2.94m x 2.45m - Half paneling to walls\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nWorkshop/Store: 7.62m x 4.85m"
      },
